config LITEHTML
	bool "litehtml HTML/CSS renderer"
	depends on CPP && RISCV
	help
	  Build litehtml (the litehtml submodule) as a separate static library
	  with the C++ standard library of the toolchain, and link it into the
	  image. The library draws a page into an RGB565 buffer with a bitmap
	  font, see include/litehtml_zephyr/lh.h.
